Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm God, you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't do any—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You runaway brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ignorant fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The great principle of capitalism is give-and-take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as give-and-give!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't act on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You came looking for love,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and yet you reject me?{TODO ugh wat do}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I physically can't stand his looks or his smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's always hard to understand how you girls think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we agree on that, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you haven't gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:13.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even back then, you only went\None subway stop from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got scared and ran back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there was no place for you, was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your parents don't love you.\NI'm the only one who will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you ran away, weren't you saved for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was blowing off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of relationship you should have built.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's blow off each other's steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll blow it off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why's his mind down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing I eat will taste right for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give-and-give would just be gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:35.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having somebody protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:18.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got lost?\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:33.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in! It's cramped, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Aonuma Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, how polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ai's Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Aren't you Mr. Sawaki's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Momoe. I'm his niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:00.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pretty young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have that cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lay out Neiru's snacks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have so many friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't even finished yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:22.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, you're really my uncle's student, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear he's crazy popular with the girls at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were a guy, I'd want to date you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:36.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think Koito liked Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl Ai's trying to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just had a crazy idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:06:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ai's best friend Koito\Nwas actually dating Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, something terrible happened, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Do you have company?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:10.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai's friends are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My uncle's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's so nice that he adopts lots of rescue cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just likes cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might have a dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A teacher got hands on with a student,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and when it got dicey, bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pregnant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really don't know why Koito died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not ask your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mr. Sawaki told her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe he only checks on you every week
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because he thinks you've got some kind of proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That could be it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom really trusts Mr. Sawaki,\Nand I'm always making her worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she stopped asking about my injuries \Nafter I clammed up about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Clammed," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:33.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got allergies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's just that I can picture Ai as a clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you tell her you're going out to fight in your sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll just worry her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She might think you're on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd never believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:08:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's our story that no one else knows about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A story... that no one knows about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I recognized her because she looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're in different schools. Where did they meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll paint how you look to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it's finished, I want you to have confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize\Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish my mom was more like yours, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? What's yours like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine's toxic and awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet when I was born and first saw her face, I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"This lady wants to stay a woman her \Nwhole life and never be a parent."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Oh, no! What do I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom always does everything\Nperfectly, at work and at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She works really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think that's probably why my dad left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lots of guys are proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A capable woman actually spoils them.{TODO spoils?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an anachronistic fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "fool"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They really get along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about this spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you do hair treatments?{TODO hair treatments}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've got some damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to be free. Don't tie me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't my hair pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a single split end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm at my prettiest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing can replace youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to ask? About why I died?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just complete my objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls become adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The miraculous beauty of a butterfly emerging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A moment of shocking beauty when its \Ntransience is powerfully reflected.{TODO wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soon, beauty fades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom's just a sow.{TODO ugh}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No amount of liposuction or hyaluronic acid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will ever stop her aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:33.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, her attempts to stop it\Nare unbelievably ugly on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not die when you're at your most beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why cling to a meaningless life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I beat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?\NMirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:50.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, coast's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:03.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The crosswalk is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who wants to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a lot, huh, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bunch, actually.{TODO akshully}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!\NAi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's an echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they grew here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That reminds me; I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About six times, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is six times a lot or a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They all seriously say they love me. It's a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Admiration, maybe?{TODO meh}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like with Takarazuka?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:43.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you don't like {that}it, right, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God sure is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Outside food and drink are prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, buy your Eggs and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let us play one game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is basically a kind of group therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to let us feel that we're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might kill ourselves without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just one game.\NYes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even reach the pins before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank God for Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Momoe.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa.\NIt's like a date photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All my photos with girls come out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this picture's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka took this one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka was willing to see me as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend who killed herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she suddenly took her clothes off in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She put the moves on you? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got scared and ended up pushing her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't expect it to come from a girl who's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got chills! I was shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I have done?{TODO maybe snap}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's drop the gloomy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are lots of other games.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's play our hearts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd only play one game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NBuy Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Play well, fight well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't completely hate being popular, do you?\NEven with girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I care about the girls\Nwho follow me on Insta and things.{TODO stuff?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're half-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you end up enjoying something \Neven though you didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't beat you even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Games like that are kind of my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A gamer? You secretly a nerd?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1250,1018)}That was a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,1018)}Same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's normal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're totally a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, buy your Eggs, go home, and go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? I don't wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm having the time of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I haven't had this much fun in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief. It's your fault for spoiling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah; Neiru, can I have your contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not spoiling them; soldiers need their rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Tell me yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too much rest will make them slack off like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so uptight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we just stop buying Eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NNow that I think about it, Chiemi went and died on her own.{TODO maybe snap end}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might be true that I was the reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but dying isn't playing fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I have to feel so responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it. What Ai saw was just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a woman, so I get swept away \Nby my emotions in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rika...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you, Momoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NAre you responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you feel guilty. So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But should we really feel so \Nresponsible that we'd risk our own lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,stop it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Especially you, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She died without even talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, why do you have to go fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I want to know the truth about why Koito died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That curiosity could get you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My{\i0} parents are one thing, but you've got a great mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to make her sad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't even know if Koito {\i1}wants{\i0} \Nto come back to life in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:22.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, did Koito's statue tell you she wants to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, stop it—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone has to be the bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want friends, you've got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go, but I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For someone selfish enough to... kill themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, Neiru's trying to save her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what they told me when I woke up in the ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you've got even less of a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:26.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guilt and curiosity fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.19,0:18:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll forget 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's just adolescence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beauty is a momentary season of metamorphosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?{TODO this whole thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:02.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dying is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Killing your own beautiful body is another metamorphosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting old and ugly or trying \Nto resist aging are both comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There must be a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just comedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just got on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You actually regret it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, no one will call you pretty ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Why don't I die," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You tempted me to die, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Teenage rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll want to go if we say not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They know that doing that will build up their own identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, lend me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:48.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
